        "show_tag": false,
        "banner_intro": "<p>Yoto or Tonies? The Yoto Player and the Toniebox are the two best-known screen-free audio players in the UK. Here is how they compare on price, age, setup and what each story costs.</p><p>By the Voxblock team · Updated 11 October 2026 · 7-minute read</p><p><em>We make Voxblock, a third screen-free player, so we have included it. This guide is about Yoto and Tonies first, and we have tried to be fair to both.</em></p>"
      }
